  "name": "Oxidal Moment (Stereo)",
  "uri": "urn:oxidal:plugin:moment#stereo",
  "category": "Delay",
  "comment": "Stereo Moment: each side has its own memory. Width 0 keeps the incoming stereo picture; higher values add each mode's own movement: Tape plays one side backwards, Stretch and Slip pan slowly, Touch pans while a slice is held, Smear scatters its taps and Delay crosses from side to side. All other controls work as in the mono plugin. No latency.",
